    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say things get better but it just feels wrong. like, the \"me\" that mattered is just... done. i used to have a purpose, i had a direction. now i'm just a spectator in a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore. it's not even sadness, it's just this emptiness. like the story is already over and i'm just staring at the blank pages at the end.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
